# .dockerignore
# Anything listed here is NOT sent to Docker when you run "docker build".
# Smaller build context = faster builds, and secrets never leak into images.

# Installed on your laptop, rebuilt inside the image instead.
# Your local node_modules may contain binaries built for macOS or Windows
# that would break inside a Linux container.
node_modules
npm-debug.log*

# Git history and editor clutter.
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.md

# Never ship secrets into an image. Anyone who can pull the image can read them.
.env
.env.*

# The Dockerfile itself is not needed inside the image.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
